@startuml organization-authority-escalation-boundary
title Organization Authority Escalation Boundary ; per ADR-ES-020 section 13

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

class "Agentic Organization" as AO
class "Authority" as Auth
class "Policy" as Pol
class "Constraints" as Con
class "Governance" as Gov
class "Accountability" as Acct
class "Escalation" as Esc

AO --> Auth : operates-within
AO --> Pol : governed-by
AO --> Con : constrained-by
AO --> Gov : operates-within
AO --> Acct : accountable-to
AO --> Esc : escalates-to

note bottom of AO
  Per ADR-ES-020 section 13, agentic organizational behavior
  is bounded by authority, policy, governance, constraints,
  accountability. Escalation is first-class. Human participation
  remains valid per ADR-ES-020 section 11.
  Foundational Dependency Gate documented per ADR-ES-020 section 2.
end note

@enduml
